{"id":"488619","name":"虫草花白果瘦肉汤","author":"宸·羽","authorId":"7796837","desc":"","cover":"images/488619/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"虫草花","amount":"15g"},{"name":"白果","amount":"60g"},{"name":"红枣","amount":"30g"},{"name":"枸杞子","amount":"10g"},{"name":"瘦肉","amount":"200g"}],"sub":[{"name":"油","amount":"少许"},{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"},{"name":"鸡精","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"虫草花、鲜白果仁、红枣、枸杞子。","img":"images/488619/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"瘦肉切丁。","img":"images/488619/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"把虫草花、红枣、枸杞子泡一会儿，去除杂质。","img":"images/488619/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"白果仁焯水两分种。","img":"images/488619/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"去掉外皮。","img":"images/488619/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"将所有食材放入炖盅。","img":"images/488619/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"置入电压力锅，炖盅内加适量的水、油、盐，盖上盖。","img":"images/488619/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"启动煲汤模式。","img":"images/488619/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"时间到，撒点鸡精就可出锅了。","img":"images/488619/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"一款适合秋燥气候喝的润肺止咳、滋阴养颜汤完成。","img":"images/488619/step_10.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：电压力锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}